<section class="section"><div class="shell prose"><div class="policy-banner">MANAGEMENT REVIEW REQUIRED BEFORE PUBLICATION</div><h2>Our aim</h2><p>This site is being built so people can understand roofing services, navigate by keyboard, read content at increased zoom, and contact the business without unnecessary barriers.</p><h2>Known implementation requirement</h2><p>The live site showed horizontal overflow at 320 CSS pixels. The new build is designed to remove that issue, but management should approve the final testing evidence before making a conformance claim.</p><h2>Details still required</h2><ul><li>Target accessibility standard and review date.</li><li>Confirmed test results for keyboard, focus, contrast, forms, gallery, reflow, and zoom.</li><li>Accessibility contact route and response process.</li></ul></div></section>
